 recycle your money and when  you get your 25 grand back what are you  going to do you're going to do it again  and then you're going to get your 25  grand we're going to do it again and  you're going to keep going you're going  to get  going and that's how when i started when  i was 17 years old  from working class background with  nothing i didn't have any money  i i had to get 100 borrowed money but i  just snowballed and snowballed and  snowballed and saved my rents and saved  my rents and snowballed and snowballed  that's why now i've got a multi-million  pound property portfolio at age 29  because i used this strategy and you can  do the exact same thing now maybe you're  thinking  but samuel isn't it really risky what  happens if the property doesn't value up  you do all this work and then the  property gets down valued that's why  before you buy the property  you do diligence to make sure that there  are houses in the street that are worth  a hundred thousand pounds  so you can do a like for like comparison  so that you know what the donut value is  going to be  maybe thinking samuel what about what  about bridging finance is it hard to get  bridging finance  no it's not in fact even if you've got  bad  credit the bridging finance companies  don't care even if they don't care about  you they care about  the property so if you get good at  finding the properties  the bridging finance comes now listen  i'm not a financial advisor so of course  you know i want you to take all this  information and i want you to start  being creative and then go and get the  relevant advice from the  from the financial advisors from the  mortgage lenders  but all i'm doing is teaching you what  i've done and what i do and what i've  trained  thousands of people to do so they care  about  the house you might be thinking but  saying isn't bridging finance really  expensive  well it is typically they might charge  up  between half a percent and one and a  half percent a month  so if they're charging say one percent a  month which is pretty standard but  on the expensive side they're charging  one percent a month  that's expensive but  you're not going to have this for many  months the refurb is only going to take  three to six months  so you have to fax this into your costs  of course same as you're going to have  legal fees  but the point is you're going to have  that if you buy a house regardless  whenever you buy a house you're going to  have to pay legal fees  i mean taxes will be cheaper when you do  this strategy  because when you buy a property that's  unmortgageable you don't pay stamp duty  tax  so there's so many advantages and i want  to keep this  video brief because there's so much i  could go into you might be thinking  but what happens if the refurb goes over  25  000 pounds then you're stuffed well  again this takes  skill i wouldn't recommend just having a  bash this is a profession  so when people tell me samuel you can  just learn everything online for free  why do you run courses  by the way most of my courses are free  by the way in fact i run a property  investors crash course which is free i  welcome you to come  and attend i do a lot of training for  free but  you've got to take this seriously you've  got to put the hours in you've got to  study because this is  if you want if you want to start  recycling your cash on bridging finance  companies  and growing up a multi-million pound  portfolio i would suggest that you  sharpen the axe  and what i mean by that is you sharpen  your knowledge before you start going  doing it  for sure i mean the refurb could go over  that's why you need to make sure that  you get you've got good builders you've  got a good power team  in place you know how to find the deals  so  if you found this video helpful let me  know if you want to join me at the  property investors crash course i'll  leave a link in the description below  i also think you might find this video  really helpful where i summarize the buy  refurbished refinance strategy  so i'll see you at the property  investors crash course i'll leave a link  in the description get yourself booked  on and also  subscribe right here so you don't miss a  future video thanks  you

